    {
      "rule_id": "K06-STAIR-NATURAL-LIGHT",
      "kind": "client",
      "magnitude": "stair_natural_light",
      "operator": "in",
      "value": null,
      "unit": null,
      "parameters": {
        "sources": [
          "window"
        ],
        "window_part_order": [
          "landing",
          "flight"
        ],
        "required_by_strategy": {
          "A": true,
          "C": true,
          "D": true,
          "B": false
        },
        "normative_layer": "S12-STAIR-LIGHTING",
        "window_rule": "S13-EXTERIOR-WALL-OPENINGS"
      },
      "text": [
        "The stair receives natural light through a window on the landing (or a flight) where the exterior wall may have openings (no skylight over the stair, client decision 2026-10-10). Required for strategies A, C and D, scored for B. It never replaces the artificial lighting the code requires (S12)."
      ],
      "source": {
        "document": "Client decisions",
        "section": "2026-10-10, stair light (RuleForge two-layer rule)"
      },
