      "text": [
        "Client decision 2026-10-11: the master bedroom gets its private bath and walk-in closet first; then each other bedroom gets its own bath (en suite, opening only onto it) while the FAR allows; a bath shared by two bedrooms sits between them and opens onto the circulation; no half bath on the upper floor (the social half bath is a ground-floor space)."
